<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank raises deposit rates.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank raises deposit rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangkok Bank Plc, Thailand's biggest commercial bank, said on Thursday it raised its fixed deposit rates to 10.00-11.50 percent from 8.25-9.25 percent, effective immediately.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
